sequenceDiagram
    actor Viewer
    participant Player as Client Player
    participant ManifestService as Manifest Service
    participant LicenseServer as License Server
    participant CDNEdge as CDN Edge Node
    participant OriginServer as Origin Server
    participant Analytics as Analytics Service

    Viewer->>Player: press play
    Player->>ManifestService: request manifest
    ManifestService-->>Player: manifest (available renditions)
    Player->>LicenseServer: request DRM license
    LicenseServer-->>Player: license granted
    Player->>CDNEdge: request video segment
    CDNEdge->>OriginServer: fetch segment (cache miss)
    OriginServer-->>CDNEdge: segment data
    CDNEdge-->>Player: segment data
    Player->>Analytics: report playback started
    Player->>CDNEdge: request next segment
    CDNEdge-->>Player: segment data (cache hit)
    Player->>Analytics: report buffering event
    Player-->>Viewer: render video frame
    Player->>Analytics: report playback progress
